{"id":"c1362aafed","t":"Troublesome Young Master Theodore","c":"cv","n":20,"l":20,"s":["az"],"k":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore"},"u":1795077525587,"desc":"تجسدتُ في رِوايةٍ كانت أُختي الصُّغرى تَقرؤها. ولِلعودةِ إلى عالَمي الأصلي، لا بُدَّ من مُشاهدةِ النهايةِ المُحددةِ للرواية...لكن المُشكلةَ أنّني لم أقرأ هذه الروايةَ مِن قبل.كُلُّ ما أعرِفُه أنّ ا...","type":"","status":"","genres":[],"src":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore"},"chapters":{"1":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-1"},"2":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-2"},"3":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-3"},"4":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-4"},"5":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-5"},"6":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-6"},"7":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-7"},"8":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-8"},"9":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-9"},"10":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-10"},"11":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-11"},"12":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-12"},"13":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-13"},"14":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-14"},"15":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-theodore|/series/troublesome-young-master-theodore/chapter-15"},"16":{"az":"troublesome-young-master-the